raph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Called when the host is disconnected from the component tree. For custom\nelement hosts, this corresponds to the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"disconnectedCallback()"},{"type":"text","value":" lifecycle,\nwhich is called the host or an ancestor component is disconnected from the\ndocument."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-5","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"implementation-of-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Implementation of"}]},{"type":"code","value":"ReactiveController.hostDisconnected","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"implements","text":"Implements","level":2},{"id":"constructors","text":"Constructors","level":2},{"id":"constructor","text":"Constructor","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"host","text":"_host","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"accessors","text":"Accessors","level":2},{"id":"hotkeys","text":"hotkeys","level":3},{"id":"get-signature","text":"Get Signature","level":4},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":5},{"id":"sequences","text":"sequences","level":3},{"id":"get-signature-2","text":"Get Signature","level":4},{"id":"returns-3","text":"Returns","level":5},{"id":"methods","text":"Methods","level":2},{"id":"hostconnected","text":"hostConnected()","level":3},{"id":"returns-4","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"implementation-of","text":"Implementation of","level":4},{"id":"hostdisconnected","text":"hostDisconnected()","level":3},{"id":"returns-5","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"implementation-of-2","text":"Implementation of","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts:35](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts#L35)\n\nA Lit ReactiveController that tracks all hotkey and sequence registrations.\n\nSubscribes to the singleton HotkeyManager and SequenceManager stores and\ntriggers host updates whenever registrations change.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nclass ShortcutPalette extends LitElement {\n  private registrations = new HotkeyRegistrationsController(this)\n\n  render() {\n    return html`\n      <ul>\n        ${this.registrations.hotkeys.map(\n          (reg) => html`<li>${reg.options.meta?.name ?? reg.hotkey}</li>`,\n        )}\n      </ul>\n    `\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Implements\n\n- `ReactiveController`\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew HotkeyRegistrationsController(_host): HotkeyRegistrationsController;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts:51](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts#L51)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### \\_host\n\n`ReactiveControllerHost`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`HotkeyRegistrationsController`\n\n## Accessors\n\n### hotkeys\n\n#### Get Signature\n\n```ts\nget hotkeys(): HotkeyRegistrationView[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts:42](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts#L42)\n\nAll registered hotkeys (public view, no callbacks).\n\n##### Returns\n\n`HotkeyRegistrationView`[]\n\n***\n\n### sequences\n\n#### Get Signature\n\n```ts\nget sequences(): SequenceRegistrationView[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts:47](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts#L47)\n\nAll registered sequences.\n\n##### Returns\n\n`SequenceRegistrationView`[]\n\n## Methods\n\n### hostConnected()\n\n```ts\nhostConnected(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts:55](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts#L55)\n\nCalled when the host is connected to the component tree. For custom\nelement hosts, this corresponds to the `connectedCallback()` lifecycle,\nwhich is only called when the component is connected to the document.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nReactiveController.hostConnected\n```\n\n***\n\n### hostDisconnected()\n\n```ts\nhostDisconnected(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts:81](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts#L81)\n\nCalled when the host is disconnected from the component tree. For custom\nelement hosts, this corresponds to the `disconnectedCallback()` lifecycle,\nwhich is called the host or an ancestor component is disconnected from the\ndocument.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nReactiveController.hostDisconnected\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: HotkeyRegistrationsController\ntitle: HotkeyRegistrationsController\n---\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts:35](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts#L35)\n\nA Lit ReactiveController that tracks all hotkey and sequence registrations.\n\nSubscribes to the singleton HotkeyManager and SequenceManager stores and\ntriggers host updates whenever registrations change.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nclass ShortcutPalette extends LitElement {\n  private registrations = new HotkeyRegistrationsController(this)\n\n  render() {\n    return html`\n      <ul>\n        ${this.registrations.hotkeys.map(\n          (reg) => html`<li>${reg.options.meta?.name ?? reg.hotkey}</li>`,\n        )}\n      </ul>\n    `\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Implements\n\n- `ReactiveController`\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew HotkeyRegistrationsController(_host): HotkeyRegistrationsController;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts:51](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts#L51)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### \\_host\n\n`ReactiveControllerHost`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`HotkeyRegistrationsController`\n\n## Accessors\n\n### hotkeys\n\n#### Get Signature\n\n```ts\nget hotkeys(): HotkeyRegistrationView[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts:42](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts#L42)\n\nAll registered hotkeys (public view, no callbacks).\n\n##### Returns\n\n`HotkeyRegistrationView`[]\n\n***\n\n### sequences\n\n#### Get Signature\n\n```ts\nget sequences(): SequenceRegistrationView[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts:47](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts#L47)\n\nAll registered sequences.\n\n##### Returns\n\n`SequenceRegistrationView`[]\n\n## Methods\n\n### hostConnected()\n\n```ts\nhostConnected(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts:55](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts#L55)\n\nCalled when the host is connected to the component tree. For custom\nelement hosts, this corresponds to the `connectedCallback()` lifecycle,\nwhich is only called when the component is connected to the document.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nReactiveController.hostConnected\n```\n\n***\n\n### hostDisconnected()\n\n```ts\nhostDisconnected(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts:81](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/hotkey-registrations.ts#L81)\n\nCalled when the host is disconnected from the component tree. For custom\nelement hosts, this corresponds to the `disconnectedCallback()` lifecycle,\nwhich is called the host or an ancestor component is disconnected from the\ndocument.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nReactiveController.hostDisconnected\n```\n"}
